    "body": "<b>FreeBuds Client</b> {version}<br><br>Unofficial desktop client for HUAWEI FreeBuds, in English.<br>Battery readings and ANC control over SPP/RFCOMM.<br>Audio, gesture, and connection settings validated on FreeBuds Pro 5.<br>Multipoint, spatial effects, case sounds, and swipe remain read-only.<br><br>Protocol validated from Bluetooth captures and subject to variation across models and firmware."
